Yes. For now, route these to Claims Intake as FlexCard claims and code them u=
nder DOP-208 until registration status is verified in CardView. If the accoun=
t is not yet registered, hold the usual Reg E liability and error-resolution =
workflow in abeyance and follow the Cardholder Agreement disclosure.

For general-purpose FlexCard accounts (not payroll FlexCard accounts) where H=
arborline has not completed customer identification and verification, the Reg=
ulation E liability limits and error resolution requirements do not apply unt=
il verification is complete, as disclosed in the Cardholder Agreement.

Please make sure the associates note the verification status in ClaimTrack an=
d attach the CardView print to the case file. If the customer later completes=
 verification, the case can be reactivated without a new claim intake. We sho=
uld also keep Compliance in the loop because this came up in the prepaid rule=
 go-live review.

